    state completed
    intent """
        Add an optional VLM pass: one suggested scene description per keyframe.
        Captions enter as observations on the original video timeline, never as
        facts, never verified, never naming a person. JSON is the test path; a
        local CLI (ollama-class) is the overnight path.
        """
    acceptance {
